Control for tuxxy/tbtc-v2#24 (D13 refinement): the minimal correct fix.
Removes the reserved-main exception to "FROST sweep main required": while a
FROST wallet's main is reserved, an ordinary deposit sweep is refused whether
or not it claims the main. The C-04 sweep-resolution route (proveResolution,
includeMain with the reservation's resolution id) and a no-main wallet's
deposit-only first sweep are unchanged. Never applied in the committed tree.

